# The pictures of constraints.md: a rectangle whose depth is held to
# half its width by a ratio, so that one dimension on the width sizes
# both.
cursor on
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 400 340
down L 400 340
up L 400 340
key esc
click-entity 40000
move 300 200
down L 300 200
up L 300 200
shot constraints-1-two-sides
key z
edit 0.5
key esc
cursor off
shot constraints-2-ratio gw
click-entity 70000
key d
edit 60
key esc
menu View|Zoom To Fit
menu View|Zoom Out
cursor off
shot constraints-3-width-60 gw
